# Vanta G4b (0005): seeded Canvas 2D readback noise (persona canvas = Noise).
# getImageData (HTML + OffscreenCanvas 2D), toDataURL, toBlob and
# OffscreenCanvas.convertToBlob of 2D contexts. Opaque antialiased pixels
# only, lowest bit of R/G/B, one seeded bit per pixel keyed on (seed, canvas
# x, y, colour): deterministic, idempotent (stable reads, put/get round trip
# unchanged), grey stays grey, solid fills and transparent pixels exact, all
# exits agree. The same rule serves WebGL readbacks (readPixels RGBA8,
# toDataURL/toBlob/convertToBlob of WebGL canvases) with webgl_image and
# seeds.webgl. Mode Block: readbacks of that surface are transparent black.
# Needs 0004 (platform/vanta/vanta_persona.h).

